# Platform team owns the Terraform account/platform layer and workflow orchestration
/terraform/               @platform-team
/.github/                 @platform-team

# Data engineering owns the DCM-managed database object layer, including its own CI
# pipeline files — kept separate from Terraform's since dcm-plan.yml/dcm-deploy.yml split
# out from the combined terraform-plan.yml/terraform-apply.yml specifically so each tool's
# pipeline could be owned/reviewed independently.
/dcm/                      @data-engineering-team
/.github/workflows/dcm-plan.yml     @data-engineering-team
/.github/workflows/dcm-deploy.yml   @data-engineering-team

# Everyone reviews shared documentation
*.md                      @platform-team @data-engineering-team
